1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,203
Speaking, task four. Situation number 2. The examiner describes a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:17,773
On Saturday evening we want to go out together. Where shall we go? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:26,467 --> 00:00:27,989
How about going to the cinema?

4
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,759
I don't feel like the cinema, I was there yesterday.

5
00:00:31,067 --> 00:00:32,482
Then we can go to the theatre.

6
00:00:32,767 --> 00:00:34,113
The theatre is too expensive.

7
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:35,908
Then let's go to a restaurant.

8
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:37,716
And why do you want to go there?

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,658
Because we are hungry and we can talk there in peace.

10
00:00:40,967 --> 00:00:44,696
OK, that's a good idea. Let's go to a restaurant.

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:53,956
Practise situation 2 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
